599
00:34:26.999 --> 00:34:29.232
- It's actually a foundry.

600
00:34:35.240 --> 00:34:36.773
- Like for a smith?

601
00:34:36.775 --> 00:34:38.041
- Yeah, I mean I guess so

602
00:34:38.043 --> 00:34:39.142
but it doesn't look
like it's been used

603
