683
00:39:14.286 --> 00:39:15.185
- Tyler?

684
00:39:17.622 --> 00:39:18.521
Tyler?

685
00:39:22.327 --> 00:39:23.793
Tyler?

686
00:39:23.795 --> 00:39:24.694
Tyler?

687
00:39:25.964 --> 00:39:26.863
Tyler?

688
00:39:27.899 --> 00:39:28.798
Tyler?!

689
